Hi [Name],

We’re evaluating RTX’s participation as a contributing member of the Open Applications Group (OAGi) Industrial Ontologies Foundry (IOF) — an industry consortium advancing open ontologies for data and model interoperability across manufacturing and enterprise systems.

This membership would give RTX access to the standards, tools, and resources the IOF community has been developing, while also allowing us to contribute to and help shape emerging ontology standards relevant to our Digital Thread and Ontology initiatives.

We’d like to identify representatives from each business unit who could participate in IOF working groups. Please let me know if you’d like to recommend someone from your organization or discuss potential alignment areas.

Best regards,
